OL,3,GNEWSA'Our SEND kids are not entries on
OL,4,Aa balance sheet'
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents and carers of children with
OL,7,Fspecial educational needs and
OL,8,Fdisabilities (SEND) have described
OL,9,Ffeeling ignored by Leeds City Council,
OL,10,Fwith one saying their child was treated
OL,11,Flike a "number".
OL,13,FIt follows an improvement notice being
OL,14,Fsent to the authority by the Department
OL,15,Ffor Education over the quality of its
OL,16,FSEND services.
OL,18,FChris Hassall said his daughter's
OL,19,Fwelfare was "in jeopardy" after what he
OL,20,Fsaid were repeated delays in securing
OL,21,Fan assessment for an education, health
OL,22,Fand care (EHC) plan for her.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
